68	 * - VTC_api_wrongMethod: adapted to an HTTP method not registered for this exact path
69	 * pattern (DELETE; only GET and PUT are mapped for /api/owners/{ownerId}) -> 405.
70	 * - VTC_api_emptyBody / VTC_api_structureTamper: NOT APPLICABLE. GET requests to this
71	 * endpoint carry no request body, so "empty body" and "tampered body structure" mutations
72	 * have no meaningful effect distinct from the happy path; per the pipeline's documented
73	 * fallback for non-applicable mutation cases, these are intentionally not implemented as
